@startuml Saga_InventoryFailed
title Saga-хореография: ошибка резервирования → отмена заказа

participant "Event Bus" as Bus
participant "Inventory Service" as Inventory
participant "Order Service" as Order
participant "Notification Service" as Notify
participant "Покупатель" as Customer

== Начало: OrderCreated уже опубликован ==

Bus -> Inventory: OrderCreated
activate Inventory
Inventory -> Inventory: Проверка остатков
Inventory -> Bus: **InventoryReserveFailed** (товара нет)
deactivate Inventory

Bus -> Order: InventoryReserveFailed
activate Order
Order -> Order: Статус → CANCELLED
Order -> Bus: **OrderCancelled**
deactivate Order

Bus -> Notify: OrderCancelled
activate Notify
Notify -> Customer: Push: «Заказ отменён: товара нет в наличии»
deactivate Notify
@enduml